      "text": "/skill:tidy-recipe-authoring\n\nCreate tidy recipes for workbook `985a4cc0b042c6f45a8c50eaef9f5e8cf8b982237dda32e55cc54ed41d633f79--WalgettLGA.xlsx`.\n\n- Publication: BOCSAR — Crime statistics by LGA (NSW Bureau of Crime Statistics and Research)\n- Release or year: Current file checked 2026-11-01\n- Sheets needing a recipe: 7 of 7\n\n| sheet | sheet_sha256 | current recipe |\n|---|---|---|\n| \"Summary of offences\" | f7dab95fcc80f3f93b7090b056a911ce04d554bf0f55bd665e6d6d5d80a7d808 | missing |\n| \"Premises Type\" | 891afda4e65933aa4c0c049ed8381fe6c69a931fcab196e4270006207c6694f6 | missing |\n| \"Victims\" | 9fa13a2f6ef69c41b0585b47a7a9fd3ccf0e18af7c41054d722874cee14ded87 | missing |\n| \"Offenders\" | be1fe48ad2b3e206328cea0fa7ad77324415408b63a1359df6a4c52270a164ae | missing |\n| \"Alcohol Related\" | 161fa3f77a10600f8b8468224a9bb5a1e2e2a7e09e900a21bd96c3457885944a | missing |\n| \"Month\" | d37b19a6a41e3efc41de21cf2acf39190fc983762dd75ace30fc621212f7d0bb | missing |\n| \"Time\" | 1ccaf0960fae3f42d35de27b2c0af6a87e4646babda4ad3512bf8f56313a2260 | missing |\n\nRelated workbooks:\n- None\n\nWork through every sheet listed above using the skill's workflow. Use\n`codemode` scripts to call the recipe tools, and batch the work: for example,\nlist the workbook and check templates for all sheets in one script, then read\ngrids and test recipes a few sheets at a time. Keep script output short.\n\nName dimensions from `dictionary/dimensions.csv` (see the skill's\n`references/naming.md`); declare any name it lacks in `new_dimensions`.\n\nWrite each recipe to `tidy-recipes/<sheet_sha256>.json` and finish every sheet\nwith `submit_recipe`. You may only write recipe files for this workbook.\n\nEnd with one line per sheet: `sheet | kind | status | records | remaining failures`."
